Sages from east south and west arrive to congratulate Rāma --- Rāma seats sages and receives praise --- Sages hail Rāvaṇa, Kumbhakarṇa and chiefs slain --- Sages marvel most at invincible illusionist Indrajit slain --- Rāma wonders at Indrajit praised above Rāvaṇa --- Rāma asks Indrajit power, boon and Śakra conquest